UniXNU-Pagani_SM8750 (github.com/Shad0w23333/UniXNU-Pagani_SM8750), 25b110978fec628cc29bf5bd1b5b5ce830156bfd (unixnu.lock),
BSD-2-Clause-Patent (sha256 5b1d3d911103cb0f41641ec0964c5ac1f7e229f57aa072b6ac38bae913a1307b), the 13T's GPU board:
  package/PaganiGpuBoard.cpp (bd3ae49476ab8b1775f3c7b35f84478a90880cd382ac89ce6890d47aed21bc72) -> board/PianoA830Board.cpp.
    Kept: fillBoard (every field, the slot/bank policy, ACTLR 0x303, pool 512 MiB, highest bank bit 16), the firmware pins.
