macOS-DroidVM (github.com/Droid-VM/macOS-DroidVM; local droidvm-build/macOS-DroidVM, read only), 11ac316 (branch el1/native-variant),
BSD-2-Clause-Patent (SPDX headers): overlay/kext/DroidVMGpuKext.cpp (b312016ace4de3a69209626690234ca20ab3e25678b2a7ace1d1234b2109317b)
and overlay/kext/DroidVMGpu.json (46b6274795be70cf55601616361b801edc8b58b7a9990104408e850e588ce7e7): the AGXAccelerator class (an
IOAccelerator subclass carrying MetalPluginName/MetalPluginClassName, the logged property reads and opens) and its personality and
vtable check, in board/PianoA830.cpp and tooling/k27/kext/PianoA830.json. Removed: DroidVMGpuStarter, the virtio-gpu hooks and the
weak NativeAdreno 805c7e4 stubs. No DroidVM kext is linked (docs/PROJECT-MAP.md rule 8).

This repository's own, not from upstream: board/ (BSD-2-Clause-Patent, but for the derived files above), abi/NativeAdrenoABI.h (a
wrapper that includes Adreno830's v2 header unchanged and adds the one v1 name Turnip's darwin KMD uses; MIT like the header it
wraps) and abi/abi_handshake.cpp (BSD-2-Clause-Patent; the KMD's call sequence, run on Adreno830's tests/hostsim by
tooling/k27/check-a830-abi-host.py).

Data (facts, not code):
  piano's boot DT out/inputs/piano-boot.dtb (sha256 50636effb5f54306ec0ab9a3061cd163d7f003d8797e04585a33205918856840, the DT ABL
  hands Ubuntu's mainline kernel) and piano's live stock DT unixnu-research/Unixnu-SM8750-Piano/inputs/piano-live.dtb (sha256
  ed6e1a3c663fda03e833297170542ad6916791999fc685a6597672a2535ce76b): board/PianoGpuInputs.h and board/piano-gpu-inputs.json.
  The firmware identities of xiaomipad-8pro-mainline firmware/piano-gpu.json (OS3.0.303.0.WPYCNXM): board/piano-gpu-firmware.json.
  The firmware itself is never in this repository (embedded at build time from the ignored out/native-kexts/PianoA830/firmware).

Specification only (never copied): Linux drm/msm, KGSL, clk/qcom (GPL-2.0). Adreno830's A830Regs.h and the generated A830HwInit.h
are register facts as upstream ships them; nothing was added from GPL sources.
